# Ascend's caller-facing collection is EXTRACTED from its own website, so it is
# derived — rebuild with `npm run voice:kb`. Ignored so nobody hand-edits a file
# the next build overwrites, and so the allowlist in scripts/build-voice-kb.mjs
# stays the only thing deciding what a caller can be told.
# Other tenants' collections ARE committed: their source documents are the
# deliverable, not a by-product of this repo.
voice-tenants/ascend/kb/
